            "patch": {
                "description": "Update information of an existing task in the system\n### Field update logic (Three-state logic):\n1. **Field omitted**: `description` is ignored, DB value remains unchanged\n2. **Explicit value provided**: `\"description\": \"Go for a walk with Milo at 06:30 AM\"` - sets the new description in the DB\n3. **null provided**: `\"description\": null` - clears the field in the DB (set to NULL)\nConstraints: `title` and `completed` cannot be set to null",
